{"asset_key":"mn2/quest_story_10284430","episode":"mn2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10284430","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:3:1028443001:0":{"text":"사슴이 안 보이네요...","source_cn":"没见到鹿的影子……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFF92A88E3D687E64","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1028443002:0":{"text":"아참, 우리 어떤 사슴을 찾는 거였더라?","source_cn":"对了，我们是要找什么鹿来着？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9789AF1710D7A0DF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1028443003:0":{"text":"바보 치피! 수사슴과 암사슴!","source_cn":"牡鹿和牝鹿——也就是公鹿和母鹿！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x50F29A6591B7960C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1028443004:0":{"text":"그런데 왜 꼭 암수 한 마리씩일까? 같은 종의 외형적 차이를 가르치려는 건가?","source_cn":"不知道为什么一定要公母各一只呢？是为了教学同物种间外形...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x65C267CB2807E2B6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1028443005:1":{"text":"음... 모르겠어!","source_cn":"唔……不懂！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8C2FB4EF0CD24ADF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1028443006:0":{"text":"그런데 선생님이 확실하게 안 알려주고 너무 급히 가버렸어요. 전처럼 또 같은 사슴을 데려오면 시간이 지체될 거예요.","source_cn":"不过，那位老师走得太急了，确实没说清楚。要是再像之前那...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB1B297718FC2402B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:9:1028443006":{"text":"그런데 선생님이 확실하게 안 알려주고 너무 급히 가버렸어요. 전처럼 또 같은 사슴을 데려오면 시간이 지체될 거예요.","source_cn":"不过，那位老师走得太急了，确实没说清楚。要是再像之前那样，大家凑巧都带回了同样长相的鹿，就又要耽误时间了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB1B297718FC2402B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1028443007:1":{"text":"... 누구요? 왜 저를 보시는 거죠?","source_cn":"……谁？你看我干什么？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xEBC938172EC3F77C","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"... 누구요? 왜 저를 보시는 거죠?","female":"... 누구요? 왜 저를 보시는 거죠?","variant_male_record_index":"111954","variant_female_record_index":"111955","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:11:1028443007":{"text":"... 누구요? 왜 저를 보시는 거죠?","source_cn":"……谁？你看我干什么？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xEBC938172EC3F77C","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"... 누구요? 왜 저를 보시는 거죠?","female":"... 누구요? 왜 저를 보시는 거죠?","variant_male_record_index":"111954","variant_female_record_index":"111955","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1028443008:1":{"text":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님, 저한테 꼭 은혜 갚으세요, 잊지 마시라고요...","source_cn":"<style=stress><player_name>...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x20803F17F8BDDF79","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님, 저한테 꼭 은혜 갚으세요, 잊지 마시라고요...","female":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님, 저한테 꼭 은혜 갚으세요, 잊지 마시라고요...","variant_male_record_index":"111956","variant_female_record_index":"111957","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1028443009:1":{"text":"알겠어요, 연락해 볼게요...","source_cn":"好吧，我来联系她吧……","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x38EDC04BC2E8874D","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"알겠어요, 연락해 볼게요...","female":"알겠어요, 연락해 볼게요...","variant_male_record_index":"111958","variant_female_record_index":"111959","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1028443010:1":{"text":"...바람아, 메시지를... 전해다오...","source_cn":"……风啊，带去……讯息……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE9EF003DB88B7170","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1028443011:1":{"text":"“우리는 뭘 찾아야 하죠? 갑자기 귀에 들려오는 소리에 놀라지 마요! 그리고 제발 짧게 핵심만 말해줘요!”","source_cn":"“我们要找的是什么？别对突然传到你耳朵里的声音太惊讶！...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x22A379139177C732","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1028443012:1":{"text":"... ","source_cn":"…………","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x70646B5D874C111A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:17:1028443012":{"text":"... ","source_cn":"…………","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x70646B5D874C111A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1028443013:1":{"text":"방금 암사슴을 만나서 데려가고 있다네요. 우린 <style=\"highlight\">수사슴</style>만 찾으면 돼요.","source_cn":"她说刚刚碰见一头母鹿，正在引它往回走。我们要找<sty...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x854CA91A722BED48","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1028443014:1":{"text":"이제 목표가 확실해졌네요! 그런데 표정이 왜 그래요?","source_cn":"这样目标就清晰了！但是，你怎么这副表情？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7FD9A469B5AD7205","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1028443015:1":{"text":"여러분이 정말 부러워요.","source_cn":"我，现在很羡慕你们。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC02CB386526682C2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:21:1028443015":{"text":"여러분이 정말 부러워요.","source_cn":"我，现在很羡慕你们。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC02CB386526682C2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1028443016:1":{"text":"방랑자의 능력이 없는 여러분이 정말 부럽네요. 이 사람의 끝도 없는 질문을 안 들어도 되잖아요!!","source_cn":"真羡慕你们没有风语者的能力，听不到她那一长串连气都不喘...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64"